{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The quietude of the chamber has assumed the character of a pressure, a negative space which determines itself solely through what it excludes. Hegde stands in the corner, a living error in the ledger of the Directorate, while Ramesh waits with that patience which belongs to a man whose labor has been suspended by my poverty. I am unable to find rest; for the body demands sustenance, yet the purse holds nothing but the remnants of tea and samosas, which prove insufficient for the next meal. I am compelled to observe the tension between these two men, for in their stagnation resides the truth of my present existence: a state of affairs which has not yet resolved itself into action."}}],"created":1795128648,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":140,"prompt_tokens":191,"total_tokens":331,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-AqHyKq8xYrAZm3RZlAj1XAtdhWoVVdRE","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":191,"prompt_ms":456.6,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.390575916230367,"prompt_per_second":418.3092422251423,"predicted_n":140,"predicted_ms":3377.252,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.296776978417267,"predicted_per_second":41.15772231388123}}